msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"I ran out of money and got evicted from my apartment. I'm lookin' for a new "
"place around here, but the rent is so damn high!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"So you're gonna help me out, buddy. 100,000 yen should about cover it. So "
"you gonna spot me or what!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Okay, okay, enough! I get it, alright? You beat it into me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"Man, you beat it into me so hard, I think I'm gonna cry. Here, this is all I"
" got on me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "You got a fishy %s."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto un %s sospetto."

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Shit, I think... Yeah, you definitely broke something. What now? I can't "
"afford to go to the ER..."
msgstr ""

